{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-gateway","title":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/caching-gateway","wordCount":736,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关层缓存-减少后端压力的响应缓存策略\">网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>缓存键（Cache Key）</strong></td>\n<td>唯一标识一个缓存条目的标识符（通常由 Method + Path + 关键 Header/Query 构成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cache-Control</strong></td>\n<td>HTTP 标准头，定义缓存行为（max-age、no-cache、private 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ETag</strong></td>\n<td>响应内容的指纹，用于条件请求（避免传输未变更的内容）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Vary Header</strong></td>\n<td>声明响应会随哪些请求 Header 变化（影响缓存键构建）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>缓存穿透（Cache Stampede）</strong></td>\n<td>热点缓存过期瞬间，大量请求同时打穿到后端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"哪些响应适合在网关缓存\">哪些响应适合在网关缓存？</h2><p>网关缓存最适合以下场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适合缓存</th>\n<th>不适合缓存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公开内容（不含用户个性化数据）</td>\n<td>包含用户私有数据的响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新不频繁的数据（配置、分类列表）</td>\n<td>实时性要求高的数据（库存、价格）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GET / HEAD 请求</td>\n<td>POST / PUT / DELETE 请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明确设置了 Cache-Control: public</td>\n<td>Cache-Control: private 或 no-store</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存键设计\">缓存键设计</h2><p>缓存键必须唯一区分不同的响应，但不能过于细粒度（否则命中率极低）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"基础键: {METHOD}:{PATH}&#10;&#10;加入查询参数（影响结果的参数）:&#10;  GET /api/products?category=electronics&amp;sort=price&#10;&#10;不加入查询参数（不影响结果的参数）:&#10;  ?utm_source=newsletter  （追踪参数，不影响内容）&#10;  ?_t=1234567890          （时间戳防缓存，客户端用但不应影响服务端缓存）&#10;&#10;加入关键 Header（内容因 Header 变化）:&#10;  Accept-Language: zh-CN   → 中文版响应&#10;  Accept-Language: en-US   → 英文版响应&#10;  → 键中需要包含语言维度&#10;&#10;不加入大多数 Header（User-Agent、Cookie 等会让键过于细粒度）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>基础键: {METHOD}:{PATH}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>加入查询参数（影响结果的参数）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  GET /api/products?category=electronics&#x26;sort=price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不加入查询参数（不影响结果的参数）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ?utm_source=newsletter  （追踪参数，不影响内容）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ?_t=1234567890          （时间戳防缓存，客户端用但不应影响服务端缓存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>加入关键 Header（内容因 Header 变化）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Accept-Language: zh-CN   → 中文版响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Accept-Language: en-US   → 英文版响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 键中需要包含语言维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不加入大多数 Header（User-Agent、Cookie 等会让键过于细粒度）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-vary-header\">使用 Vary Header</h3><p>后端服务通过 <code>Vary</code> Header 告诉网关&quot;响应依赖哪些请求 Header&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Vary: Accept-Language, Accept-Encoding&#10;Cache-Control: public, max-age=300&#10;&#10;# 网关缓存键自动加入 Accept-Language 和 Accept-Encoding\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Vary: Accept-Language, Accept-Encoding</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Cache-Control: public, max-age=300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 网关缓存键自动加入 Accept-Language 和 Accept-Encoding</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓存-ttl-策略\">缓存 TTL 策略</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 不同路由的缓存策略示例&#10;cache_policies:&#10;  - path: &#39;/api/v1/categories&#39;&#10;    ttl: 3600 # 分类数据，1 小时&#10;    method: [GET]&#10;&#10;  - path: &#39;/api/v1/config&#39;&#10;    ttl: 300 # 配置数据，5 分钟&#10;    method: [GET]&#10;&#10;  - path: &#39;/api/v1/products/:id&#39;&#10;    ttl: 60 # 商品详情，1 分钟（价格可能变化）&#10;    method: [GET]&#10;&#10;  - path: &#39;/api/v1/user/*&#39;&#10;    ttl: 0 # 用户数据，不缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不同路由的缓存策略示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cache_policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/categories'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 分类数据，1 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/config'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 配置数据，5 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/products/:id'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 商品详情，1 分钟（价格可能变化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/user/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 用户数据，不缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"条件请求-conditional-requests\">条件请求（Conditional Requests）</h2><p>使用 ETag 减少带宽：即使内容未变化，也不传输响应体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant GW as API Gateway(有缓存)&#10;    participant US as 上游服务&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/categories&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /api/categories&#10;    US--&gt;&gt;GW: 200 + body + ETag: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 缓存响应(key: GET:/api/categories, etag: abc123)&#10;    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 200 + body + ETag: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;&#10;    Note over C,GW: 60 秒后缓存过期&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/categories(无缓存)&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /api/categories\\nIf-None-Match: &quot;abc123&quot;&#10;    US--&gt;&gt;GW: 304 Not Modified(无 body,内容未变)&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 刷新缓存 TTL,使用旧 body&#10;    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 200 + 旧 body(或 304)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant GW as API Gateway(有缓存)\n    participant US as 上游服务\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/categories\n    GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /api/categories\n    US--&gt;&gt;GW: 200 + body + ETag: \"abc123\"\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 缓存响应(key: GET:/api/categories, etag: abc123)\n    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 200 + body + ETag: \"abc123\"\n\n    Note over C,GW: 60 秒后缓存过期\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: GET /api/categories(无缓存)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;US: GET /api/categories\\nIf-None-Match: \"abc123\"\n    US--&gt;&gt;GW: 304 Not Modified(无 body,内容未变)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 刷新缓存 TTL,使用旧 body\n    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 200 + 旧 body(或 304)</pre><p>304 响应省去了响应体的传输，显著降低带宽和后端计算开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存穿透防护-stampede-prevention\">缓存穿透防护（Stampede Prevention）</h2><p>热点缓存到期时，同一秒可能有 1000 个请求同时打到后端。防御策略：</p>\n<h3 id=\"加锁-互斥锁\">加锁（互斥锁）</h3><p>只允许一个请求去后端刷新，其他等待：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (c *CacheLayer) Get(key string, fetcher func() ([]byte, error)) ([]byte, error) {&#10;    // 1. 读缓存（命中直接返回）&#10;    if val, ok := c.cache.Get(key); ok {&#10;        return val, nil&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 2. 获取分布式锁（防止多个 goroutine 同时回源）&#10;    lock := c.lockManager.Acquire(key, 5*time.Second)&#10;    defer lock.Release()&#10;&#10;    // 3. 双重检查（拿到锁后可能已经被别人刷新了）&#10;    if val, ok := c.cache.Get(key); ok {&#10;        return val, nil&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 4. 回源获取&#10;    val, err := fetcher()&#10;    if err == nil {&#10;        c.cache.Set(key, val, c.ttl)&#10;    }&#10;    return val, err&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CacheLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fetcher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() ([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) ([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 1. 读缓存（命中直接返回）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key); ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 2. 获取分布式锁（防止多个 goroutine 同时回源）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.lockManager.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 3. 双重检查（拿到锁后可能已经被别人刷新了）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key); ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 4. 回源获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    val, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        c.cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, val, c.ttl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提前续期-early-expiration\">提前续期（Early Expiration）</h3><p>在缓存实际过期前（如剩余 10% TTL 时），异步后台刷新，不等真过期：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (c *CacheLayer) Get(key string, fetcher func() ([]byte, error)) ([]byte, error) {&#10;    val, remaining, ok := c.cache.GetWithTTL(key)&#10;    if ok {&#10;        // 还有数据，但 TTL 不足 10%，后台异步刷新&#10;        if float64(remaining) &lt; float64(c.ttl)*0.1 {&#10;            go c.refresh(key, fetcher)  // 不阻塞当前请求&#10;        }&#10;        return val, nil&#10;    }&#10;    // 缓存完全过期，同步刷新&#10;    return c.syncRefresh(key, fetcher)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CacheLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fetcher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() ([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) ([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    val, remaining, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetWithTTL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ok {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 还有数据，但 TTL 不足 10%，后台异步刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(remaining) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.ttl)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, fetcher)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不阻塞当前请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 缓存完全过期，同步刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">syncRefresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, fetcher)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"缓存负样本-negative-caching\">缓存负样本（Negative Caching）</h3><p>对&quot;不存在的资源&quot;的查询也缓存（返回空结果），防止攻击者用不存在的 key 绕过缓存打数据库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"GET /api/products/99999999&#10;  → 数据库查询 → 不存在&#10;  → 缓存 {key: &quot;product:99999999&quot;, value: null, ttl: 60s}&#10;  → 下 60s 内相同请求直接返回 404，不访问数据库\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /api/products/99999999</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 数据库查询 → 不存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 缓存 {key: \"product:99999999\", value: null, ttl: 60s}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  → 下 60s 内相同请求直接返回 404，不访问数据库</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓存的一致性问题\">缓存的一致性问题</h2><p>网关缓存对写操作不可见，存在数据短暂不一致的窗口。处理方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>写后失效（Write-Through Invalidation）</strong></td>\n<td>写操作后主动通知网关删除对应缓存</td>\n<td>数据重要性高，允许增加复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>短 TTL</strong></td>\n<td>接受短暂不一致，依靠 TTL 自然过期</td>\n<td>大多数读多写少场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cache-Control: no-cache</strong></td>\n<td>只缓存但每次都验证新鲜度（ETag）</td>\n<td>数据更新频率不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关缓存是减少后端负载、降低延迟的有效手段，适合公开的、更新频率低的 GET 响应。缓存键设计需要在命中率和正确性之间权衡（过粗则错误命中，过细则命中率低）。ETag 条件请求减少带宽消耗；互斥锁和提前续期防止缓存穿透；负样本缓存防止空查询攻击。网关弹性完整体系见本章<a href=\"circuit-breaking-retry\">熔断与重试</a>和<a href=\"rate-limiting-throttling\">限流与节流策略</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","id":"网关层缓存-减少后端压力的响应缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"哪些响应适合在网关缓存？","id":"哪些响应适合在网关缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存键设计","id":"缓存键设计"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 Vary Header","id":"使用-vary-header"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存 TTL 策略","id":"缓存-ttl-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"条件请求（Conditional Requests）","id":"条件请求-conditional-requests"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存穿透防护（Stampede Prevention）","id":"缓存穿透防护-stampede-prevention"},{"level":3,"text":"加锁（互斥锁）","id":"加锁-互斥锁"},{"level":3,"text":"提前续期（Early Expiration）","id":"提前续期-early-expiration"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存负样本（Negative Caching）","id":"缓存负样本-negative-caching"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存的一致性问题","id":"缓存的一致性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/circuit-breaking-retry"},"next":{"title":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/gateway-logging-metrics"}}